commit 991266ad300f47a3b9f21e62ff5bdb679215e758
Author: Alessio Pollero <alessio.pollero@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Oct 24 00:19:36 2026 +0400

    Clear the MLX buffer cache after each prefill chunk (#710)
    
    Each prefill chunk grows the KV cache into new, larger buffers. The
    buffers it outgrows return to the MLX buffer cache, but no later chunk
    can reuse them, so they stay there until generation clears the cache
    on its first token. On long prompts this cache grows by gigabytes.
    
    mlx-lm calls mx.clear_cache() after every prefill chunk. Do the same in
    PrefillParameters.forEachChunk, which drives the prefill of every LLM
    and VLM, so all models get the fix.

