commit bb0d5b048f02e14dbf8f2d7bb1a20911a295470a
Author: David Koski <46639364+davidkoski@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Tue Oct 20 15:41:26 2026 -0700

    fix loratrain for tiny prompts (#683)
    
    - LoRA is given N tokens, trims to N-1 to predict N
    - if N is 1 it cannot predict from zero
    - previously this would fatal error deep inside mlx core
    - this adds an error in the typical path
    - and a fatal with a more descriptive message if you get to the inner API
    - discovered in #680

